      col
        h1 Pagination
        h2 A responsive, usable, and flexible pagination
      col
        card
          link "https://srv.carbonads.net/ads/click/x/GTND4277CVBD6KQICVYLYKQUF67ITKJLC6SDTZ3JCAAI653UCKSIKK3KF67D42QYF6BIL5QUC67DPK3JCVYIT2QKC6SILKJWCYADEK3EHJNCLSIZ" https://srv.carbonads.net/ads/click/x/GTND4277CVBD6KQICVYLYKQUF67ITKJLC6SDTZ3JCAAI653UCKSIKK3KF67D42QYF6BIL5QUC67DPK3JCVYIT2QKC6SILKJWCYADEK3EHJNCLSIZ
          link "Roles change. AWS credentials travel with you. Get certified" https://srv.carbonads.net/ads/click/x/GTND4277CVBD6KQICVYLYKQUF67ITKJLC6SDTZ3JCAAI653UCKSIKK3KF67D42QYF6BIL5QUC67DPK3JCVYIT2QKC6SILKJWCYADEK3EHJNCLSIZ
        link "ads via Carbon" http://carbonads.net/?utm_source=bulmaio&utm_medium=ad_via_link&utm_campaign=in_unit&utm_term=carbon
    text The pagination component consists of several elements:
    text pagination-previous and pagination-next for incremental navigation
    text pagination-list danger
    text pagination-link for the page numbers
    text pagination-ellipsis for range separators
    text All elements are optional so you can compose your pagination as you wish.
    text Example
    row
      link Previous #
      link "Next page" #
      row
        link "Goto page 1" #
        text …
        link "Goto page 45" #
        link "Goto page 47" #
        text …
        link "Goto page 86" #
    text HTML
    button "Show code" danger
    text "<nav class=\"pagination\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"pagination\"> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-previous\">Previous</a> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-next\">Next page</a> <ul class=\"pagination-list\"> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 1\">1</a> </li> <li> <span class=\"pagination-ellipsis\">&hellip;</span> </li> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 45\">45</a> </li> <li> <a class=\"pagination-link is-current\" aria-label=\"Page 46\" aria-current=\"page\" >46</a > </li> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 47\">47</a> </li> <li> <span class=\"pagination-ellipsis\">&hellip;</span> </li> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 86\">86</a> </li> </ul> </nav>"
    button Copy danger
    text You can disable some links if they are not active, or change the amount of page numbers available.
    text Example
    row
      link "Next page" #
      row
        link "Goto page 2" #
        link "Goto page 3" #
    text HTML
    button "Show code" danger
    text "<nav class=\"pagination\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"pagination\"> <a class=\"pagination-previous is-disabled\" title=\"This is the first page\" >Previous</a > <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-next\">Next page</a> <ul class=\"pagination-list\"> <li> <a class=\"pagination-link is-current\" aria-label=\"Page 1\" aria-current=\"page\" >1</a > </li> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 2\">2</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 3\">3</a> </li> </ul> </nav>"
    button Copy danger
    text By default on tablet, the list is located on the left, and the previous/next buttons on the right. But you can change the order of these elements by using the is-centered and is-right modifiers.
    text Example
    row
      link Previous #
      link "Next page" #
      row
        link "Goto page 1" #
        text …
        link "Goto page 45" #
        link "Goto page 47" #
        text …
        link "Goto page 86" #
    text HTML
    button "Show code" danger
    text "<nav class=\"pagination is-centered\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"pagination\"> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-previous\">Previous</a> <a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-next\">Next page</a> <ul class=\"pagination-list\"> <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 1\">1</a></li> <li><span class=\"pagination-ellipsis\">&hellip;</span></li> <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 45\">45</a></li> <li> <a class=\"pagination-link is-current\" aria-label=\"Page 46\" aria-current=\"page\" >46</a > </li> <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 47\">47</a></li> <li><span class=\"pagination-ellipsis\">&hellip;</span></li> <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"pagination-link\" aria-label=\"Goto page 86\">86</a></li> </ul> </nav>"
    button Copy danger
